USDCraft Reproduction on Articraft

This is an unofficial research reproduction and is not NVIDIA's USDCraft source
code or an official NVIDIA release. No NVIDIA SDK binaries are redistributed.

The Python package and authoring SDK are derived from Articraft:
https://github.com/articraftresearch/Articraft
https://github.com/mattzh72/articraft
Original package metadata identifies Matthew Zhou as the author.
The supplied upstream LICENSE (Apache License 2.0) is preserved unchanged.
The working project was obtained as a ZIP; its exact upstream commit was not
recorded. This publication copy does not invent an upstream revision or history.

USDCraft reproduction additions include source-surface observations, geometric
rechecking and local diagnosis, file-based modeling sessions, whole-program
repair workflows, and the separate native PhysX acceptance bridge and scripts.
The source-only repository preparation also adds portable native configuration,
offline example entry points, publication hygiene and contributor documentation.

Vendored build123d documentation and reference figures are runtime SDK reference
material, not project experiment results. See
src/articraft/sdk/docs/build123d/VENDORED.md for provenance and limitations.
Upstream copyright and licensing notices in those files are retained.
